
### get all Venues
GET http://localhost:3000/api/venue


### get one Venue
GET http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1

### create a new Venue
POST http://localhost:3000/api/venue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Broadway",
  "address": {
    "street": "Av. Corrientes",
    "streetNumber": "1234",
    "postalCode": "C1043",
    "locality": "CABA",
    "province": "Buenos Aires",
    "googleMapsUrl": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/example1"
  }
}

### create a Venue without the optional googleMapsUrl (también válido)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/venue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hipódromo",
  "address": {
    "street": "Av. del Libertador",
    "streetNumber": "4400",
    "postalCode": "S2000",
    "locality": "Rosario",
    "province": "Santa Fe"
  }
}

### create a Venue with invalid data -> debe responder 400
### (faltan calle y localidad, y el link de maps no es una URL válida)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/venue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "address": {
    "street": "",
    "streetNumber": "100",
    "postalCode": "S2000",
    "locality": "",
    "province": "Santa Fe",
    "googleMapsUrl": "no-es-una-url"
  }
}


### update a Venue (PUT - full, idempotent resource)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/venue/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hipódromo de Rosario",
  "address": {
    "street": "Av. del Libertador",
    "streetNumber": "4400",
    "postalCode": "S2000",
    "locality": "Rosario",
    "province": "Santa Fe",
    "googleMapsUrl": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/example2"
  }
}

### update a Venue (PATCH - partial resource)
### Ojo: sanitizeVenueInput arma el objeto "address" completo a partir de
### req.body.address, así que aunque la ruta sea PATCH hay que mandar la
### dirección entera (el frontend siempre envía el formulario completo).
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatrito",
  "address": {
    "street": "Av. Corrientes",
    "streetNumber": "1234",
    "postalCode": "C1043",
    "locality": "CABA",
    "province": "Buenos Aires"
  }
}

### delete a Venue
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/venue/2

### delete a Venue that has events or ticket types asociados -> debe
### responder 409 con un mensaje explicando por qué no se puede borrar
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1
